&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="citation-ref"&gt;&lt;a href="#ThinkBayes01"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="satisfying-the-axioms-of-probability"&gt;Satisfying the Axioms of Probability&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id="axiom-1-normalization"&gt;Axiom 1: Normalization&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;$$ \mathbb{P}(B|B) = \frac{\mathbb{P}(B \cap B)}{\mathbb{P}(B)} = 1 $$&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>[ToDo] Think Bayes</title><link>https://www.curiosities.dev/todo/mathematics/think-bayes/</link><pubDate>Tue, 24 Sep 2013 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.curiosities.dev/todo/mathematics/think-bayes/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
